  "translation": "Na haus bilong Yakov bai i kamap paia, na haus bilong Yosef bai i kamap leiba bilong paia, na haus bilong Esau bai i olsem gras drai; na ol i ken statim paia long ol na kaikaiim ol; na i no bai i stap wanpela man i lus bilong haus bilong Esau, bilong wanem Yahwe i tok pinis.",
